Description: libadwaita look for GTK 3 apps (adw-gtk3)
 An unofficial GTK 3 port of the libadwaita style, in a light (adw-gtk3)
 and a dark (adw-gtk3-dark) variant, so GTK 3 apps match the GTK 4 ones.
 It follows the accent color set with GTK named colors (accent_bg_color),
 which the Swaydesk Theme app uses.
 .
 Packaged for the Swaydesk repository from the upstream release, with the
 same name as the Arch Linux package.
